  "content": "<p>《史詩騎士：冰與火》是《<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights</a>》模組的精彩擴展，並與《<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ice and Fire</a>》模組結合。此附加內容為玩家提供了20種新武器類型，使用來自冰與火的14種材料製作，每種材料都為武器帶來了特殊效果。</p><p>此專案需要安裝《<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Epic Knights</a>》模組及其所有依賴項。大多數紋理由 StaxiHD 創作。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1030/206/weapons.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"591\"></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
